              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मेहंदी — mehndī — \"henna\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शादी के दिन मीरा के हाथों में मेहंदी लगी थी। śādī ke din Mīrā ke hāthoṁ meṁ mehndī lagī thī. On her wedding day Mira's hands were patterned with henna."
            },
