              "text": "सगाई — sagāī — \"an engagement (to marry)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पिछले साल मीरा की सगाई हुई। pichle sāl Mīrā kī sagāī huī. Mira got engaged last year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
