          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सगाई (sagāī) is probably the noun of sagā, \"of full blood relationship\", which CDIAL lists under svagya-, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 13896b): the promise that makes two families kin. CDIAL does not give the \"engagement\" sense itself."
            }
          ]
        },
